{{/* @dot donseba/go-webthings-docs/internal/website.DocsArticleData */}}
<article class="grid max-w-5xl gap-6">
    {{ template "hero.gohtml" . }}

<p>Describe the inputs with struct tags, render them through <code>html/template</code>, and map a submitted request back into typed data. Your application owns routing, business rules and persistence.</p>
<h2>The form workflow</h2>
<ol><li>Create and configure one form renderer.</li><li>Wrap the web handlers with its CSRF middleware.</li><li>Render input data with request-specific form metadata.</li><li>Parse and map a submission, then validate it.</li><li>Redisplay field errors or save through the application service.</li></ol>
<pre><code>type Contact struct {
    Name string `name:"name" form:"input,text" label:"Name" required:"true"`
    Email string `name:"email" form:"input,email" label:"Email" required:"true"`
}</code></pre>
<h2>Explore the guide</h2>
<ul><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/installation" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Installation and first render</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/fields" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/fields" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Input types, tags and choices</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/metadata" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/metadata" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Form metadata and request tokens</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/submissions" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/submissions" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Mapping and handling submissions</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/validation" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/validation" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Built-in and custom validation</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/csrf" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/csrf" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">CSRF tokens and shared stores</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/themes" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/themes" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Themes and custom templates</a></li><li><a href="{{ basePath }}/translations" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/translations" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">Localized forms and errors</a></li></ul>
<p>The <a href="{{ basePath }}/integrations" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/integrations" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">component integration guide</a> covers go-partial and HTMX. The <a href="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-get="{{ basePath }}/api" hx-target="#content" hx-push-url="true">API reference</a> collects the renderer, metadata and error types.</p>
</article>
